  <div id="stage">
    <canvas id="canvas" width="640" height="640"></canvas>

    <div id="menu" class="overlay">
      <h2>Snake 30×30</h2>
      <p>Choose a game mode. Eat the red food to grow and score. Hit a wall or a snake and it's over.</p>
      <div class="menu-list">
